                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>• Consumer segment generates the highest sales, followed by Corporate and Home Office.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>• West region has the highest sales among the regions, while South has the lowest.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>• Technology is the most profitable category, showing strong contribution to overall profit.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>• Sales show an upward trend toward the end of the year, with November and December among the strongest months.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>• The Top 10 Products by Sales highlight the products contributing most to overall revenue.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='10'>• Overall, the dashboard shows strong sales performance with opportunities to improve lower-performing regions and segments.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
